window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The time has come to end the reign of dragons.</b></p> <p>My family has played god with shifters for over eight centuries. They've conquered in silence, have gathered and saved power for themselves, failing their people.</p> <p>No more.</p> <p>The draca live. All four of us are alive, on the same timeline, and we have what it takes to summon the Ether and bring back the balance of elements in our world. Give the people back their magic. Put a stop to the Azarius reign.</p> <p>Except the Ether might not be who we think he is...</p> <p>Will summoning him really be the beginning of a new, better world?</p> <p>Or the deadliest mistake anyone's ever made?</p>"; 
